<div class="side-by-side">
  <h2>The Challenge</h2>
  <p>
    To cement its identity as a product for gamers, Mountain Dew wanted an
    esports spectacle that felt monumental. The new franchise needed an identity
    that matched the neon-powered, futuristic and colorful brand. I led the
    creative team to develop a new franchise connecting MTN DEW directly to
    gamers.
  </p>
</div>

