<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">Bringing the Halo Community Together</p>
  <p>
    We brought Mountain Dew's series to a thrilling conclusion with the Halo
    Infinite Community Gauntlet, a celebration of Halo’s competitive legacy,
    which saw over 250 longtime Halo players competing across an experience
    deeply rooted in Halo tradition. Halo Infinite's Forge allowed us to develop
    branded maps.
  </p>
</div>

