<h2>The Impact</h2>

<div class="side-by-side">
  <p>
    67% of all Halo Infinite Twitch viewership during peak hours came from
    Mountain Dew tournaments.
  </p>
  <p>
    2.2M+ Twitter/X views, 740K+ YouTube views, 438K+ Twitch views:
    outperforming KPIs.
  </p>
  <p>
    Our Halo Infinite Community Gauntlet format was so popular, 343 Industries
    extended its map playlist to include it.
  </p>
</div>

